  "text": "proprium.dominica-in-albis-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Low Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We beseech Thee, O Lord our God, that the most holy mysteries which Thou hast bestowed as a safeguard of our restoration may be for us a remedy both now and hereafter. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
